# Topic permissions.
#
# The server sees everything. Each strip is confined to its own prefix, so one
# compromised strip cannot read or switch another. Add a stanza per strip, using
# the strip's MQTT client name as both the username and the topic prefix.

user powercord-server
topic readwrite #

# --- one stanza per strip -----------------------------------------------------
# Copy this block for each unit, replacing 88D039B2588D with its topic prefix.
#
# user 88D039B2588D
# topic write 88D039B2588D/+/get
# topic write 88D039B2588D/connected
# topic write 88D039B2588D/ip
# topic write 88D039B2588D/rssi
# topic write tele/88D039B2588D/SENSOR
# topic read  88D039B2588D/+/set
# topic read  cmnd/88D039B2588D/+
